### place an order, copy trackingCode from the response
POST http://localhost:5276/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### track it, no token
GET http://localhost:5276/api/orders/track/PASTE-CODE-HERE

### a random valid GUID
GET http://localhost:5276/api/orders/track/3f2b8c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### not a GUID
GET http://localhost:5276/api/orders/track/abc